# Route: guide 44 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to
# 60, 54 quests, 3.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tanaris, Durotar, The Hinterlands, Hillsbrad Foothills, Alterac
# Mountains, Silverpine Forest, Swamp of Sorrows, Thousand Needles, Un'Goro
# Crater, Blasted Lands, Moonglade): Gadgetzan -> Noonshade Ruins -> Gadgetzan
# -> Zul'Farrak -> Gadgetzan -> Broken Pillar -> Lost Rigger Cove -> Sen'jin
# Village -> Valley of Trials -> Skull Rock -> Jintha'Alor -> The Overlook
# Cliffs -> Tarren Mill -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Recover the Key! (7846; Hitah'ya
# the Keeper 51); Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions (7861; Vile
# Priestess Hexx 51, Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guard 50-51); The Crown of Will
# (519; Targ 41, Muckrake 40, Glommus 39); The Crown of Will (520; Mug'thol
# 43); Assault on Fenris Isle (442; Thule Ravenclaw 24); It's Dangerous to Go
# Alone (3962; Blazerunner 56).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll
# Temper (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The
# Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets
# (4788), Jammal'an the Prophet (1446), The Grave Knight (96986), Heart of
# Disruption (96984), The Grave Knight (96986), Opportunistic Education
# (96987), Arugal Must Die (1014), Arugal Must Die (1014), Into The Scarlet
# Monastery (1048), Deathstalkers in Shadowfang (1098), Deathstalkers in
# Shadowfang (1098), The Power to Destroy... (5725), The New Plague (95216),
# Heart of Disruption (96984), Source of Power (96988), Gahz'rilla (2770).

